        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Employees requesting Time-In-Title and Grade and Time-In-Location waivers as trailing spouses or because of a hardship, may participate in the LTP without meeting Time-In-Title and Grade or Time-In-Location criteria, if approved by the Company. However they are subject to all other LTP eligibility criteria.",
